   "id": "md6-trailing-separator-in-the-pattern",
   "resourceType": "PARITY_SUITE_MATCH_MD6",
   "about": "A separator at the end of the pattern. The pattern also has the shape x34-regex-literal records as accepted and always false, a value between two slashes, so two false answers here are equally explained by the trailing separator and by that reading. md7 does not separate the two, because its pattern has no trailing slash to drop.",
